# =============================================================================
# Production Environment Variables — committed to git (non-secret values only)
# =============================================================================
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are embedded in the client bundle at build time and are
# intentionally public (Supabase anon key is designed to be public; RLS
# enforces access control). SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY is NOT here — it must
# be set as a secret in Vercel project settings or via the deploy workflow.
# =============================================================================

